Discover how to make super versatile cannabis-infused salt that can jazz up anything from your margarita glass to popcorn. **What we want is a 2:1 ratio of salt to cannabis tincture mixed in a dish with a large surface area. We'll evaporate the alcohol off, frequently stirring, leaving us with cannabis-coated salt crystals.**
